    hasSFX: 0
    soundEffect: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8761e788d2911dc46aea67b19efc1c48, type: 3}
    _line: (But I can't swim, or I'd dive in myself. Looks like his friends passed
      out, too. There has to be some tool I can use to get him out of there...)
    _speakerProperties:
    - _speakerType: 1
      _name: 
